div.p:
Whereas the high contracting parties consider that the increase and consolidation
                    of their mutual commercial interests would be better promoted by the definite
                    limitation of the duration of the said convention;

His Majesty the King of the Hawaiian Islands, Henry A. P. Carter, accredited to
                    the Government of the United States, as His Majesty’s envoy extraordinary and
                    minister plenipotentiary;
